  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposal fails to meet the requirements of Class MA of Part 16, Schedule 2, in regards to Part 3 (f) of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) and therefore prior approval is refused as a result of the proposal not having adequate natural light in all habitable rooms.&nbsp;",
    "The proposed development, in the absence of a legal agreement to secure car-free housing,&nbsp; and lack of adequate information to determine if sufficient cycle parking can be provided, fails to promote sustainable modes of transport and would contribute to air pollution and congestion in the surrounding area,&nbsp; contrary to part MA.2(2)(a) of Class MA, Part 3, Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended)."
  ],
